cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with
  the paper describing the Expected Value Method (Birch & Singh, 2014).
type: software
title: "EVMavg.jl: Averaging with the Expected Value Method in Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for averaging data with uncertainties using the
  Expected Value Method (EVM) of Birch & Singh (2014), including
  asymmetric uncertainties, internal and external uncertainty
  estimates, and a goodness-of-fit confidence level.
authors:
